  "details": "TLDR: Thumbnails to be consistent so I can make them pretty and a way to upload thumbnails through the VRChat Website please!\n\nHello All,\n\nWith all the new UI changes within VRChat and on the website, it would be nice for a little bit more consistency with scaling for the thumbnails so that they can be made to look nice and uniformed/not cutoff in certain sections.\n\nIt would also be great to be able to edit/change thumbnails through the website (Worlds and Avis!). Makes it easier for holiday edits and not having to use the camera method within unity for example. \n\nThanks so much!",
